[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - No node is a descendant of A (since the graph has no edges from A), so B, C, D are all 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - Therefore, the result is: `A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0` — which matches the observation.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - ✅ Valid.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m #### Case 2: Perturb(B)
