[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m   - B is a parent of A.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m   - D is a parent of A.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - A is a child of both B and D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - No other edges exist, and no other nodes are connected.
