[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - **From C -> B**: C is a downstream of B (i.e., B is an upstream cause of C). So perturbing C would cause B to be 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - **From D -> C**: D is a downstream of C (i.e., C is an upstream cause of D). So perturbing D would cause C to be 1.
