[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m   - Therefore, D is 0, which matches the observation.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m #### Check Perturb(D): A:1, B:1, C:1, D:0
