[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m #### Case 1: Perturb(B)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - B is perturbed (0).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - B -> A (so A is a downstream of B).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - B -> C (so C is a downstream of B).
