[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - A is upstream of B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - C is upstream of B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m - D is upstream of B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2716495)[0m 
